<Window x:Class="KomorebiDashboard.MainWindow"
        xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation"
        xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml"
        xmlns:views="clr-namespace:KomorebiDashboard.Views"
        xmlns:ui="clr-namespace:Wpf.Ui.Controls;assembly=Wpf.Ui"
        Title="Komorebi Admin Dashboard"
        Height="720" Width="1100"
        WindowStartupLocation="CenterScreen"
        Background="{DynamicResource ApplicationBackgroundBrush}">
  <!--
    Hosts the six tab Views. All it does is place them; every button inside them
    is generated from VerbRegistry, so this window needs no per-verb wiring
    either (ADR-0009 / ADR-0013).

    x:Name IS LOAD-BEARING. MainWindow's constructor attaches each View's
    DataContext via FindName, and FindName only finds NAMED elements in the
    namescope. Without these names every FindName returns null and the app dies
    on startup with a NullReferenceException before a window ever appears
    (defect D18). The static suites could not catch it because nothing in them
    launched the app; tests/ticket11-threading.tests.ps1 now really launches it.

    The Fluent title bar is ui:TitleBar, a plain Control whose Show* properties
    are set here. Those property names are verified against WPF-UI 4.3.0 by
    reflection, not assumed: an earlier draft used a `ui:TitlebarButtons`
    attribute and a `TitleBar.Template` override, neither of which exists in
    this version, and both would have failed to parse at runtime.

    Custom chrome (WindowStyle=None + AllowsTransparency) was tried and
    rejected: it costs the window its native resize and maximise behaviour,
    which is priority-2 damage bought for priority-4 looks.

    The theme toggle lives here rather than inside a tab because it is not a
    per-mechanism action: it applies to the whole window.
  -->
  <Grid>
    <Grid.RowDefinitions>
      <RowDefinition Height="Auto" />
      <RowDefinition Height="*" />
    </Grid.RowDefinitions>

    <ui:TitleBar Grid.Row="0"
                 Title="Komorebi Admin Dashboard"
                 ShowMinimize="True"
                 ShowMaximize="False"
                 ShowClose="True" />

    <Grid Grid.Row="1">
      <Grid.RowDefinitions>
        <RowDefinition Height="Auto" />
        <RowDefinition Height="*" />
      </Grid.RowDefinitions>

      <Grid Grid.Row="0" Margin="12,8,12,0">
        <TextBlock Text="Komorebi Admin Dashboard" FontSize="15" FontWeight="SemiBold"
                   VerticalAlignment="Center" />
        <Button x:Name="ThemeToggle"
                Content="Toggle theme"
                HorizontalAlignment="Right"
                Padding="12,5"
                Click="OnToggleTheme"
                ToolTip="Switch between the Dark and Light Fluent themes" />
      </Grid>

      <TabControl Grid.Row="1" Margin="8">
        <TabItem Header="Kill and Start"><views:KillStartView x:Name="KillStartView" /></TabItem>
        <TabItem Header="Restart and Reloading"><views:RestartView x:Name="RestartView" /></TabItem>
        <TabItem Header="Settings"><views:SettingsView x:Name="SettingsView" /></TabItem>
        <TabItem Header="AutoHotkey Scripts"><views:AutoHotkeyView x:Name="AutoHotkeyView" /></TabItem>
        <TabItem Header="Debugging"><views:DebuggingView x:Name="DebuggingView" /></TabItem>
        <TabItem Header="Uninstall and Cleanup"><views:UninstallView x:Name="UninstallView" /></TabItem>
      </TabControl>
    </Grid>
  </Grid>
</Window>